# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_9667> (triamcinolone)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_9667> "A C<small><sub>21</sub></small>-steroid hormone that is 1,4-pregnadiene-3,20-dione carrying four hydroxy substituents at positions 11β, 16α, 17α and 21 as well as a fluoro substituent at position 9. Used in the form of its 16,17-acetonide to treat various skin infections.")
